    "body": "in my old config i have enabled `zls` through vim.lsp.enable and i get suggestions about variable in the current source file. While when i have added `zls` to vim.lsp.enable in minimax it didn't suggestions any i see a prompt that zls is loading and reached 100% but i do not get any suggestions. Why is that?\r\n\r\nI didn't change anything for mini.nvim default configs.",
