                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "further investigation making mini.complation function to `now` instead of `later` only fixs it.\r\nhere:\r\nhttps://github.com/nvim-mini/MiniMax/blob/44a93eaf2652cb437a27489c9620f4b1b4221141/configs/nvim-0.11/plugin/30_mini.lua#L367",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">further investigation making mini.complation function to <code class=\"notranslate\">now</code> instead of <code class=\"notranslate\">later</code> only fixs it.<br>\nhere:<br>\n</p><div class=\"Box Box--condensed my-2\">\n  <div class=\"Box-header f6\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-bold\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/MiniMax/blob/44a93eaf2652cb437a27489c9620f4b1b4221141/configs/nvim-0.11/plugin/30_mini.lua#L367\">MiniMax/configs/nvim-0.11/plugin/30_mini.lua</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mb-0 color-fg-muted\">\n         Line 367\n      in\n      <a data-pjax=\"true\" class=\"commit-tease-sha Link--inTextBlock\" href=\"/nvim-mini/MiniMax/commit/44a93eaf2652cb437a27489c9620f4b1b4221141\">44a93ea</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"Box-body p-0 blob-wrapper blob-wrapper-embedded data\">\n    <table class=\"highlight tab-size mb-0 js-file-line-container\" data-tab-size=\"8\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n\n        <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L367\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"367\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC367\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> <span class=\"pl-c1\">later</span>(<span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>() </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p></p>",
                    "bodyText": "further investigation making mini.complation function to now instead of later only fixs it.\nhere:\n\n  \n    \n      MiniMax/configs/nvim-0.11/plugin/30_mini.lua\n    \n    \n         Line 367\n      in\n      44a93ea\n    \n  \n  \n    \n\n        \n          \n           later(function()",
