                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "install zls and enable it through vim.lsp.enable. open this code in example:\r\n```zig\r\nconst std = @import(\"std\");\r\n\r\npub fn main() !void {\r\n    // try to type std\r\n}\r\n```\r\nno suggestions will show up, then go to minimax and change `later` to `now` as i shown above then reopen the file.\r\nyou will get suggestions!! (: ",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">install zls and enable it through vim.lsp.enable. open this code in example:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-zig notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"const std = @import(&quot;std&quot;);\n\npub fn main() !void {\n    // try to type std\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-v\">std</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">@import</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"pl-k\">pub</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">fn</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">main</span>() <span class=\"pl-k\">!</span><span class=\"pl-k\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"pl-c\">// try to type std</span>\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">no suggestions will show up, then go to minimax and change <code class=\"notranslate\">later</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">now</code> as i shown above then reopen the file.<br>\nyou will get suggestions!! (:</p>",
                    "bodyText": "install zls and enable it through vim.lsp.enable. open this code in example:\nconst std = @import(\"std\");\n\npub fn main() !void {\n    // try to type std\n}\nno suggestions will show up, then go to minimax and change later to now as i shown above then reopen the file.\nyou will get suggestions!! (:",
