                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "> open this code in example:\r\n\r\nThe important part is that the Neovim is probably started with `nvim file.zig`, right? In that case, 'mini.completion' has not yet started by the time LSP server is attached. Does replacing `later` with `now_if_args` solve the issue in your case?",
                    "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">open this code in example:</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The important part is that the Neovim is probably started with <code class=\"notranslate\">nvim file.zig</code>, right? In that case, 'mini.completion' has not yet started by the time LSP server is attached. Does replacing <code class=\"notranslate\">later</code> with <code class=\"notranslate\">now_if_args</code> solve the issue in your case?</p>",
                    "bodyText": "open this code in example:\n\nThe important part is that the Neovim is probably started with nvim file.zig, right? In that case, 'mini.completion' has not yet started by the time LSP server is attached. Does replacing later with now_if_args solve the issue in your case?",
